# Purpose: Copy the selected package artifact without text conversion so NUL and non-UTF-8 bytes remain intact.
# Inputs: build/packages/active.path selects the source; build/packages/agent.bundle is an opaque binary package and alternate.bundle is a plain-text test package.
# Outputs: archive/agent.bundle: byte-identical archived artifact; stdout returns the same bytes.
accept active_path as text with default "build/packages/active.path"
run mkdir with flags ["-p"] and paths ["archive"]
read active_path as artifact
then cat with path artifact
then save to "archive/agent.bundle"
